The Water Leakage Sensor is used to detect water leakage and receive notifications from the mobile app. It uses an extra-low power consumption ZigBee wireless module and has a long battery life.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- Water leakage detection
- Low power consumption
- Linkage with smart devices
- Tabletop stand or wall mounting
